  "notes": [
    "Checked against shudnal-ConfigurationManager 1.1.23; ConfigurationManager.dll SHA-256: 4ae08b4de3cd80b67bef2ab0e1cdf8405aa65a94dd8e061d0f267ffbe1af671f. Game rendering was not tested.",
    "configTexts translates unchanged English interface defaults at ConfigEntry<string>.Value reads in named consumers. Custom values differing from those defaults remain unchanged at this adapter; config files, Bind defaults, ConfigDefinition sections/keys and setting IDs are not modified.",
    "Main-menu caption Mods settings is read by SetupMainMenuButton, not by the menu-start patches. The button is created by the upstream mod; an existing button may need recreation after a language change.",
    "Normal is declared as a Text - Menu default but has no Value consumer in 1.1.23. Files: is translated at its GUI label; DrawFilters also reads and writes the editable extension list, so it has no configTexts rule.",
    "The UI text table translates labels, color/type display names and synchronization tooltips at GUI consumers. Matching custom captions can display translated text too, while their stored values remain unchanged. TextField/TextArea input is not translated; RGB/HSL identifiers remain English for the upstream branch comparisons.",
    "Reset is read by compiler-generated local functions <DrawDefaultButton>g__DrawResetButton|69_0 and |65_0, confirmed in the exact DLL IL rather than their decompiled containing methods.",
    "Synchronization tooltips are translated on GUIContent.tooltip assignment in ConfigSettingEntry.GetSynchronizationContent, leaving cached source states, provider IDs, synchronization modes and policy values unchanged. Upstream exception details remain as supplied by the exception.",
    "The 1.1.23 source differs from 1.1.22 only in version constants and KeyCode recognition in the keybind filter. Existing UI/default texts and both compiler-generated Reset consumers are unchanged; exact string reads and literal methods were checked against the installed DLL."
  ],
